    "It looks like you missed a few days. Don't worry, consistency is the key ! Let's clear some of that backlog now." : {
      "comment" : "A description under the main message of the overdue banner, explaining the benefits of taking action.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数日間お休みしていたようです。大丈夫、継続が大切です！今すぐ復習を始めましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "며칠 놓친 것 같아요. 걱정 마세요, 꾸준함이 핵심이에요! 지금 밀린 학습을 시작해봐요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看起来你有几天没学习了。别担心，坚持是关键！现在开始补习吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
